t Release and Transfer Register). Gäller data från år 2020.\n\nFrån och med 2020 rapporterar medlemsstaterna aktuella utsläppsdata (European Pollutant Release and Transfer Register) årligen integrerat med utsläppsdata för Large Combustion Plants (Industrial Emissions Directive), via den integrerade LCP och E-PRTR rapporteringen. De aktuella utsläppen kopplas via ett identifikationsnummer till respektive anläggning som rapporteras till EU Registry on Industrial sites – Sites and facilities (European Pollutant Release and Transfer Register)."},"dct:identifier":"179576b7-79fe-42d5-9702-e9d93eccff69","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2020-06-24"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2022-05-03"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:52fa664e298073ef4fd79ededba11d0251f0d10c22043d57912d05728b8c3ce1_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021001975"},"dct:spatial":{"@id":"_:52fa664e298073ef4fd79ededba11d0251f0d10c22043d57912d05728b8c3ce1_b1n0"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Aktuella utsläppsdata från industrienheter (E-PRTR), förordning (EG166/2006)"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/applicableLegislation":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2023/138/oj"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/hvdCategory":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/bna/c_dd313021"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021001975","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021001975","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:registrator@naturvardsverket.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Naturvårdsverket"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.naturvardsverket.se"}},{"@id":"urn:uuid:1fe05773-1e53-243e-2b17-913b92a9a07d","@type":"dcat:Distribution","dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"https://geodata.naturvardsverket.se/inspire/pf/ows?layers=PF.ProductionFacility"},"dcat:mediaType":"application/vnd.iso.19139+xml","dct:description":